63181.3 gpu: world feature feature=bumpmap declared=25 visible=25 resolved=25 missing=0 first=METAL/METALDOOR001 resource=materials/Metal/metaldoor001_normal.vtf reason=the materials name 17 distinct $bumpmap textures, so the one sampler slot the pass started with cannot apply each material's own; per-material binding is the --world-material-bump switch, and with it on the 14 that do not set $ssbump sample their own tile through a texinfo-axis tangent basis while the 11 that do stay refused (see the $ssbump row)
